  "commit": "28eaf9455bad6ff52dcbdbc29ecc07d7dde83e2a",
  "how": "dataclasses.asdict(devloop.config.load_config()) and review_policy.version(), computed by the code and the devloop/config.toml of that commit (origin/main before ADR 0006, R3), without overlay nor project file; tuples written as lists",
  "updated": "later changes of the installation, not R3's, added to config.toml and here with only the values they add (the policy version does not change): [apps.implementer], implementers and agents.*.app (issue #407, PR #442); delegations.capacity and capacity_max_* (issue #412, PR #450); [tests], the selection of the test modules and the format of the CI logs that the code of that commit had built in (devloop/localtests.py), declared since ADR 0006, R5 (issue #424); agents.*.provider, provider of the fallbacks and review_policy.provider_quorum (issue #409); review_policy.fallback_provider_ban (issue #410); delegations.budget (issue #411, PR #449); review_policy.findings_reviewer (issue #416); delegations.merge, max_merges_per_day and merge_trust_paths (issue #486)"
